# test/erp-demo.http
### health
GET https://localhost:65511/

### create work order
POST https://localhost:65511/erp/work-orders
X-API-Key: change-me-demo-key
X-Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": "WO-123",
  "workOrderNumber": "WO-2025-0001",
  "itemId": "I-0001",
  "qty": 100,
  "status": "P",
  "startTs": "2025-08-20T06:00:00Z",
  "idempotencyKey": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### change status
PUT https://localhost:65511/erp/work-orders/WO-123/status
X-API-Key: change-me-demo-key
X-Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "R",
  "changedAt": "2025-08-20T07:00:00Z",
  "idempotencyKey": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### create performance
POST https://localhost:65511/erp/performances
X-API-Key: change-me-demo-key
X-Idempotency-Key: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": "WO-123",
  "itemId": "I-0001",
  "processId": "P-0001",
  "equipmentId": "E-0001",
  "goodQty": 98,
  "defectQty": 2,
  "startTime": "2025-08-20T07:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2025-08-20T07:30:00Z",
  "idempotencyKey": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

### backflush (shadow-handled)
POST https://localhost:65511/erp/consumptions/backflush
X-API-Key: change-me-demo-key
X-Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": "WO-123",
  "lines": [
    { "componentId": "RM-001", "qty": 98.0, "uom": "EA" },
    { "componentId": "RM-002", "qty": 49.0, "uom": "EA" }
  ],
  "idempotencyKey": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}